---
// PricingTeaser.astro
---

<section class="bg-gradient-to-b from-white via-slate-50/50 to-white py-24 md:py-32 border-b border-slate-100">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 text-center">

    <!-- Section Badge -->
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-100 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-600 mb-4 shadow-sm">
      <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-600 animate-pulse"></span>
      Transparent Investment
    </div>

    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 leading-tight">
      Transparent Pricing. <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-600 to-teal-600">Real Business Value.</span>
    </h2>

    <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto font-normal">
      We don’t build cheap, low-quality templates. We engineer structured, conversion-focused web systems built specifically to scale your revenue.
    </p>

    <!-- Pricing Card Box -->
    <div class="mt-14 bg-white border border-slate-200/80 rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-12 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl hover:border-emerald-200 transition-all duration-300 relative overflow-hidden text-left">
      <!-- Top Accent Bar -->
      <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-1.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-500 to-teal-500"></div>

      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-6 pb-8 border-b border-slate-100">
        <div>
          <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider px-3 py-1 rounded-lg bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-600">Starting Investment</span>
          <h3 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mt-2">
            ₹8,999 <span class="text-base font-normal text-slate-500">/ project onwards</span>
          </h3>
        </div>
        <a
          href="https://wa.me/919352563337"
          target="_blank"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-emerald-600 text-white px-6 py-3 font-semibold hover:bg-emerald-700 transition shadow-lg shadow-emerald-600/10"
        >
          Discuss Your Project
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick inclusions grid -->
      <div class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">
          <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-600 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold">✓</span>
          Custom UI/UX & Conversion Architecture
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">
          <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-600 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold">✓</span>
          Direct WhatsApp Enquiry Integration
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">
          <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-600 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold">✓</span>
          Lightning Fast Mobile-First Speed
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">
          <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-600 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold">✓</span>
          SEO-Ready Technical Structure
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="mt-8 text-xs text-slate-400 text-center md:text-left">
        * Final investment depends strictly on project scope, custom features, and specific page requirements.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Detailed Pricing CTA Link -->
    <div class="mt-10">
      <a
        href="/services"
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white px-7 py-4 font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-50 hover:border-slate-400 transition shadow-sm"
      >
        View Detailed Services & Scope
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>